msgid ""
"This will remove any settings about devices that are currently offline, such "
"as Bluetooth headphones or external sound cards.\n"
"\n"
"Do you wish to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Dit zal alle instellingen verwijderen van apparaten die momenteel offline "
"zijn, zoals Bluetooth-hoofdtelefoons of externe geluidskaarten.\n"
"\n"
"Wil je doorgaan?"

